# Changelog

## 0.1.0 (unreleased)

- First version: converts legacy Calliope v0.6 models (techs, tech_groups, locations, links,
  timeseries, costs, conversion_plus, group constraints, demand_share_per_timestep_decision,
  overrides/scenarios, run scripts, SPORES config) into Calliope v0.7.0 models.
- Reports the custom math of the legacy `run.py` with math-gallery matches, and translates it as run.py writes it:
  time-varying limits, fuel distribution, EV battery capacity (`storage_ev_constraint`), capacity factors and
  per-month production. CHP `cb`/`cv`/p2h are reported only.
- Bridges structural v0.6/v0.7 differences (O&M investment fraction, resampling, objective cost classes, node names,
  x/y link distances, ...): `docs/conventions.md`, section 16.
- Optional `compare` and `fixed_design` rules to check a converted model against its legacy original on
  user-provided runs (`docs/consistency.md`).
- Snakemake module following the Modelblocks convention v1.
